The mp.hex file in this directory is actually the mp_v2-0-69_d2021-02-26.hex this is the last version from Damian Burrin.

When using VSCode and the serial monitor there are two serial ports (this is under debian 13)
- /dev/ttyACM0 - RiscV
- /dev/ttyACM1 - esp32

With the RiscV you can access the MicroPython REPL
